            "Replace serpentine rescanning with horizontal rolling sums and an s-row circular buffer of vertical contributions.",
            "Read 64-row batches through one bounded, signed-integer-aware fread parser.",
            "Use static row work sharing followed by static column-tile work sharing within one persistent OpenMP region.",
            "Use 64-bit intermediate sums, SIMD reductions, and a thread-private maximum reduction initialized for negative-only inputs."
          ]
